{"id":31,"date":"2026-06-09T15:37:00","date_gmt":"2026-06-09T15:37:00","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/floens-demo-new.local\/tower-garden-growing-resource-guide-copy-6\/"},"modified":"2026-06-29T13:12:09","modified_gmt":"2026-06-29T13:12:09","slug":"how-to-choose-the-perfect-tiles-for-every-room-in-your-home","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/how-to-choose-the-perfect-tiles-for-every-room-in-your-home\/","title":{"rendered":"How To Choose The Perfect Tiles For Every Room In Your Home"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"blog-card__text blog-card__text--one wp-block-paragraph\">Choosing tiles for your home is more than simply selecting a design you like. Every space in a home serves a different purpose, and the right tile should complement both functionality and aesthetics. For example, living rooms often look beautiful with large-format vitrified tiles that create a clean and spacious appearance, while kitchens require surfaces that are easy to maintain and resistant to stains and moisture.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Bathrooms need anti-skid tiles that provide safety without compromising style, and outdoor spaces demand materials strong enough to handle weather conditions year after year.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"blog-card__text blog-card__text--one wp-block-paragraph\">At <strong>Jain Stones &amp; Tiles<\/strong>, we always guide homeowners to look beyond just color or pattern. The right tile can completely change how a space feels, making it look brighter, larger, warmer, or more luxurious. Choosing wisely today means enjoying beautiful spaces for years to come.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\" src=\"https:\/\/stonesa